<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang=""><head><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:color="#ffffff" tts:displayAlign="after" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:fontFamily="&quot;Verdana&quot;, &quot;Arial&quot;, &quot;Tiresias&quot;, sansSerif" tts:fontSize="80%" tts:lineHeight="125%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:textOutline="#000000 5%" /></layout></head><body region="r1"><div><p begin="00:00:17.985" end="00:00:20.521"><span tts:color="#00ff00"><span tts:fontWeight="bold"><span>[train horn]</span></span></span></p><p begin="00:00:47.115" end="00:00:48.282"><span tts:color="#ff00ff"><span>[rain]</span></span></p><p begin="00:00:58.192" end="00:00:59.727"><span tts:color="#00ff00"><span>[train horn]</span></span></p><p begin="00:01:01.662" end="00:01:03.063"><span tts:fontWeight="bold"><span tts:textDecoration="underline"><span>[oven door opens]</span></span></span></p><p begin="00:01:26.787" end="00:01:29.523"><span>[whistle]</span></p><p begin="00:01:29.590" end="00:01:31.992"><span>[station speaker]</span><br /><span /><span tts:fontStyle="italic"><span>Thebakeryopensat7:35.</span></span></p><p begin="00:08:00.000" end="00:09:00.000"><span tts:fontStyle="italic"><span>Italics over two lines</span><br /><span>that close on the second line</span></span></p><p begin="00:09:00.000" end="00:10:00.000"><span tts:fontStyle="italic"><span>Italics that never close</span></span></p><p begin="00:10:00.000" end="00:11:00.000"><span>The next cue is not italic</span></p><p begin="00:12:00.000" end="00:13:00.000"><span tts:fontStyle="italic"><span>x</span></span><span>^3 * </span><span tts:fontStyle="italic"><span>x</span></span><span> = 100</span></p></div></body></tt>